  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to OECD ITF CIG4U 2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Verksamhetsst&#xf6;d till OECD ITF CIG4U 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OECD&apos;s International Transport Forum (OECD-ITF) has on Sweden&apos;s initiative created a mechanism to coordinate support for the short- and long-term needs of Ukraine&apos;s transport sector. The purpose of the mechanism Common Interest Group for Transport in Ukraine (CIG4U), is to coordinate the short- and long-term support for the development of Ukraine&apos;s transport infrastructure.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">OECD:s International Transport Forum (OECD-ITF) har p&#xe5; Sveriges initiativ skapat en mekanism f&#xf6;r att samordna st&#xf6;det till de kort- och l&#xe5;ngsiktiga behoven i Ukrainas transportsektor. Syftet med mekanismen Common Interest Group for Transport in Ukraine (CIG4U) &#xe4;r att samordna det kort- och l&#xe5;ngsiktiga st&#xf6;det f&#xf6;r utvecklingen av Ukrainas transportinfrastruktur.</narrative>
  </description>
